# Zero-Cost AI Agent Operation

## Cover Art Description
A futuristic abstract visualization representing efficient resource allocation and intelligent routing. The artwork features:
- Dark blue and purple color scheme (tech/cyberpunk aesthetic)
- Geometric shapes suggesting neural networks and data flow
- Floating code snippets and abstract circuit patterns
- Clean, minimal composition suitable for blog headers

The image conveys the theme of optimizing AI agent operations with free models and smart routing, balancing cost efficiency with performance.
